<script lang="ts">import { route } from '../lib/stores/router';let topic=$derived(new URLSearchParams($route.split('?')[1]||'').get('topic')||'delivery');</script>
<div class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE HELP, WHEN YOU NEED IT</span><h1>Here for your story.</h1><p>Everything you need to explore the RAQVOI demo.</p></div><section class="help-layout"><nav aria-label="Help topics"><a class:active={topic==='delivery'} href="#/help">Delivery & returns</a><a class:active={topic==='sizing'} href="#/help?topic=sizing">Size guide</a><a class:active={topic==='contact'} href="#/help?topic=contact">Contact & FAQs</a><a class:active={topic==='privacy'} href="#/help?topic=privacy">Privacy & demo data</a></nav><div class="help-content">{#if topic==='sizing'}<h2>A comfortable fit.</h2><p>Each product page includes an illustrative size guide from XS to XXL. Open “Size guide” beside the size selector to see sample bust, waist, and hip measurements in centimetres.</p><p>These are demo measurements. Real garment measurements and stock availability will be added with the final catalogue.</p><a class="button dark" href="#/shop">Explore pieces ↗</a>{:else if topic==='contact'}<h2>A few helpful answers.</h2><details open><summary>Can I really buy these products?</summary><p>No. This is a functional static store demonstration with illustrative products, prices and imagery. Checkout creates only a sample order in your browser.</p></details><details><summary>How do the offers work?</summary><p>Use WELCOME15 for 15% off or HER10 for 10% off in the bag. One code can be applied at a time, including to sample sale items. Shipping is not discounted.</p></details><details><summary>Where is my order confirmation email?</summary><p>No email is sent. Your sample confirmation appears on screen and in the demo account page.</p></details><details><summary>How can I contact RAQVOI?</summary><p>Official contact details have not yet been added. This demo has no live customer support or message submission.</p></details>{:else if topic==='privacy'}<h2>Your demo data.</h2><p>The bag, wishlist, selected offer, and sample order information are stored in localStorage on this browser. They are not sent to a database or payment provider.</p><p>Use sample names and email addresses at checkout. There is no real login, password storage, payment processing, analytics integration, or admin connection.</p><p>You can erase all demo data from the demo account page. Clearing browser storage also removes it. Newsletter entries are not submitted or permanently stored.</p><a class="button dark" href="#/account">Manage demo data ↗</a>{:else}<h2>Delivery & returns.</h2><div class="checkout-alert"><strong>Concept policies for a demo store. No real order or shipment is created.</strong></div><details open><summary>Demo delivery charges</summary><p>₹99 for a product subtotal below ₹3,500. Complimentary at ₹3,500 and above. The qualifying subtotal is calculated before offer codes.</p></details><details><summary>Order tracking</summary><p>Sample orders are visible in your demo account. They do not have a courier, tracking number, or delivery date.</p></details><details><summary>Returns & exchanges</summary><p>No goods are sold in this demonstration, so returns and exchanges are not processed. The final policy will be added before launch.</p></details>{/if}</div></section>
